 10. TWO DEFECTS FOUND IN THE FROZEN DOCUMENT, flagged and NOT edited: (i) Amendment 2 and Amendment 3
     use DIFFERENT angular-averaging conventions (quartic vs RMS), a 0.00094 = 0.034 sigma_tot spread
